0.0.15 One speed for all profiles. Added filament vendor. Changed thumbnail size to 380x285px.
0.0.14 Start and End g-code optimized. 
0.0.13 Added new profiles for ABS, lowered travel speed and turn on E relative distance.
0.0.12 Improve PETG cooling and removing of some profiles.
